Author: Seth Junot <xsetech@gmail.com>
Date:   Fri Feb 20 04:25:12 2026 -0800

    feat: add MPS implementation of take/take.out

    Implement take_mps and take_out_mps for the MPS backend, fixing
    TestScalarTensorMPS failure caused by missing take_stub registration.

    The MPS implementation flattens self to 1D, uses index_select to gather
    elements at the specified linear indices, and reshapes the result to
    match the index tensor's shape.

    Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>

